{"id":"soffitta","lemma":"soffitta","pos":"noun","rank":4564,"glosses":["attic, loft","apartment/flat made out of the attic; a mansarda"],"ipa":"/sofˈfit.ta/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"soffitte"},"examples":[{"text":"Sono in soffitta.","en":"I'm in the attic.","words":[{"g":"am / are","l":"essere"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Che cosa stava facendo in soffitta?","en":"What were you doing in the attic?","words":[null,null,{"g":"to stay, remain","l":"stare"},{"g":"to do","l":"fare"},{"g":"in"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"what"]]},{"text":"Puliamo la soffitta.","en":"Let's clear out the attic.","words":[{"g":"to clean","l":"pulire"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"C'è molta polvere in soffitta.","en":"There's a lot of dust in the attic.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot","l":"molto"},{"g":"dust, powder"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Si nasconda in soffitta.","en":"Hide in the attic.","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to hide, to conceal","l":"nascondere"},{"g":"in"},null]}]}